(c) the steps taken to strengthen storage, transportation and digitisation of the Public Distribution System;
(d) the measures adopted to prevent leakages and ensure transparency in ration delivery; and
(e) the initiatives undertaken to promote consumer protection, grievance redressal and awareness among consumers across the country?

(a) the details of houses sanctioned, completed and occupied under Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana–Urban (PMAY-U) during the last three years in Tamil Nadu;
(b) the total funds allocated, released and utilized under PMAY-U during the said period, year-wise;
