(d) the steps taken by Government to expedite the completion of pending housing projects, improve access to basic civic amenities, and ensure timely delivery of houses to beneficiaries?

(a) the present status of implementation of the Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN) Scheme in Tamil Nadu, including the number of farmers registered and beneficiaries receiving financial assistance, district-wise;
