(c) whether Government has assessed issues relating to beneficiary verification, exclusion of eligible farmers and grievance redressal in the State; and
(d) the steps being taken to ensure timely disbursement of benefits and wider coverage of eligible farmers in Tamil Nadu?

(a) the present status of implementation of e-Passport project in the country, including the number of e-Passports issued across the country during the last five years;
